WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.355
Today is the same move, with a new vowel.

2
00:00:02.805 --> 00:00:05.384
Watch first. Then do the same with your child.

3
00:00:05.884 --> 00:00:07.099
Here is a short word.

4
00:00:10.035 --> 00:00:11.014
The word is kit.

5
00:00:11.914 --> 00:00:13.286
Now with the e at the end.

6
00:00:16.503 --> 00:00:17.534
The word is kite.

7
00:00:18.434 --> 00:00:20.678
Listen to the middle sound without the e.

8
00:00:22.018 --> 00:00:23.582
And now with the e at the end.

9
00:00:25.103 --> 00:00:29.667
The move is the same every day. Your child looks at the end of the word first.

10
00:00:30.117 --> 00:00:34.784
Do the four pairs of job one together. You can use the card from yesterday too.

11
00:00:35.234 --> 00:00:39.596
If the e is missed, say the same words. Look at the end. Is there an e?

12
00:00:40.046 --> 00:00:43.096
For job two, press play for your child and step away.

13
00:00:43.546 --> 00:00:46.058
At the end, your child reads three words to you.
